🏡 SimsWorld - Multiplayer Life Simulator
==========================================

3D multiplayer game inspired by The Sims with internet multiplayer support.

🎯 Features:
- 🏠 Buy and own houses
- 🚶 Walk around the open world
- 👥 See other players online
- 💰 Earn money, manage needs
- 🌐 Host or join games
- 🔄 **Auto-updates** from GitHub Releases

📋 REQUIREMENTS:
1. Download Godot 4.3+: https://godotengine.org/download
2. No extra dependencies needed - everything is included!

🎮 HOW TO PLAY:
1. Open Godot Engine
2. Click "Import" and select this folder
3. Click the ▶ Play button (or F5)
4. Enter your name and choose Host/Join/Solo

⌨️ CONTROLS:
- WASD - Move
- Mouse (hold Right Click) - Look around
- Scroll - Zoom in/out
- E - Interact with houses
- Shift - Sprint
- ESC - Menu

🔄 AUTO-UPDATES:
When a new version is released on GitHub, the game automatically checks
for updates on startup and shows a dialog:

┌─────────────────────────────────┐
│  🔄 Доступно обновление!       │
│                                 │
│  📱 Текущая: v1.0.0            │
│       →                        │
│  🆕 Новая: v1.1.0              │
│                                 │
│  ✅ Обновить сейчас            │
│  ⏰ Напомнить позже            │
│  ❌ Пропустить                  │
└─────────────────────────────────┘

• Update Now - Downloads and installs automatically
• Remind Later - Checks again in 10 minutes
• Skip - Ignores this version

🌐 MULTIPLAYER:
- HOST: Click "Host Game" - others connect to your IP
- JOIN: Enter the host's IP and click "Join Game"
- Default port: 7777

💻 BUILD .EXE FOR WINDOWS:
1. In Godot: Project → Export
2. Add "Windows Desktop" preset
3. Click "Export Project"
4. Your .exe is ready!

Automatically built via GitHub Actions on every push to main.

📁 PROJECT STRUCTURE:
  scenes/
    main.tscn       - Game world scene
    menu.tscn       - Main menu scene
  scripts/
    main.gd         - Game initialization
    main_menu.gd    - Menu screen
    player.gd       - Player character
    camera_controller.gd - Third-person camera
    house.gd        - House interaction
    game_manager.gd - Economy and game state
    multiplayer_manager.gd - Network sync
    world.gd        - World generation
    auto_updater.gd - Auto-update checker
    update_dialog.gd - Update prompt UI
    server.gd       - Dedicated server
